  "releaseNotes": "Version 7.0.286\n\nFix: The configuration Dump no longer logs TLS key passwords (KeyPwd) or PSK secrets (Psk:Key, Psk:Pwd) in cleartext; these values are now masked as \"****\" in log output.\n\nFix: A malformed routes file is skipped and logged instead of aborting the configuration build.\n\nVersion 7.0.36\n\nBreakingChange: Removed the net6.0 target (.NET 6 is out of support)\n\nVersion 7.0\n\nEnh: TargetFramework dependencies changed to net8.0, net6.0, netstandard2.0",
